      "purpose": "Provides TOTP token validation helpers that configure the otplib authenticator implementations with the repository's cryptographic and Base32 encoding plugins.",
      "summary": "This module exposes two synchronous validation entry points: one for Base32-encoded shared secrets and one for raw hexadecimal secrets. Each helper applies a default validation window, injects the appropriate otplib cryptographic dependencies, preserves caller-supplied options, and delegates token verification to an otplib authenticator instance.",
      "businessContext": "Supports time-based one-time-password authentication for user or service verification. Failure prevents valid authenticator tokens from being accepted, while incorrect configuration can weaken or break login validation.",
